# Info
Event that triggers when a detector block registered in KubeJS receives a block update.

# Fields
- `event.block` - The detector block
- `event.detectorId` - The id of the detector block when it was registered
- `event.level` - The level where the detector block is located
- `event.powered` - If the detector block is powered
- `event.server` - The server where the detector block is located

# Methods
- `event.getBlock() - Returns `event.block`
- `event.getDetectorId() - Returns `event.detectorId`
- `event.getLevel() - Returns `event.level`
- `event.isPowered()` - Returns `event.powered`
- `event.getServer() - Returns `event.server`

